          "title": "Knit it Now Patterns",
          "slug": "knit-it-now-patterns",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 5999,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\n    .handwriting {'Handlee', cursive;\r\n        color: #7675C9;\r\n        font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .container-border1 {\r\n        border: 2px solid #ccc;\r\n        border-radius: 15px 50px;\r\n        padding-top: 20px;\r\n        padding-right: 20px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 20px;\r\n        padding-left: 20px;\r\n        background-color: white;\r\n        max-width: 700px;\r\n        margin: auto;\r\nbackground-color: #DCDCDC;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .img1 {\r\n        border: 3px solid #ccc;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <span class=\"handwriting\" style=\"font-size:2em\">Make sure it stays on!</span><br>When knitting sweaters, we add \"ease\" so the sweater doesn't cling.<br>For hats, it's important to make them smaller and incorporate <a data-GlossaryId=\"715\" class=\"glossaryhelp\">Negative Ease <i class=\"fa fa-question-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a>.<br>\r\n        <span class=\"yellow_highlight\"> By making the circumference of a hat smaller than the head size, we rely on the stretch of knitting to keep the hat on the head in the strongest wind.</span><br><b>The Knit it Now Hat sizing chart</b> helps you select your hat size and lists the head (actual) measurements.<br>\r\n        By default our hat patterns include 2\" of negative ease AND you can further adjust the FINISHED circumference with the Perfect Fit Dimensions.<br>\r\n\r\n    <img class=\"img1\" alt=\"\" src=\"/path/images/2764/hat1.jpg\"><br><em>Ribbing may need more negative ease because of the stretch</em><br>\r\n<br><div class=\"container-border1 text-center\"><span style=\"font-size:1.25em\"> Body measurement <b>minus</b> Finished Measurement <b>equals</b> Negative Ease</span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Default Negative Ease of Knit it Now Hat Patterns (Minus 2\" <em><small>5cm</small></em>)</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"btn-group btn-sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"...\">\r\n  <button data-show=\"inchinfo\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm groupbuttons\">Inches</button>\r\n  <button data-show=\"cminfo\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm groupbuttons\">CM</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<img id=\"inchinfo\" class=\"showinfo\" alt=\"\" src=\"/path/images/2764/inches2.png\">\r\n<img id=\"cminfo\" class=\"showinfo\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"/path/images/2764/cm.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<script language=\"JavaScript\">\r\n$('.groupbuttons').click(function() {\r\n  $('.showinfo').hide();\r\n  $('#'+$(this).attr('data-show')).show();\r\n  $('.groupbuttons').removeClass('btn-primary');\r\n\t$('.groupbuttons').addClass('btn-default ');\r\n\t$(this).addClass('btn-primary ');\r\n});\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9145,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
